      "title": "Emergency War Surgery, Third United States Revision (2004), Chapter 1 — Weapons Effects and Parachute Injuries",
      "publisher": "Borden Institute, US Army",
      "url": "https://archive.org/download/EmergencyWarSurgery_201902/Emergency-War-Surgery.pdf",
      "accessedKST": "2026-10-17",
